{"sha": "7c426e424cd192f2a9bebd0e916254595295d71ed8fbc7ace0e77420f54f1ae4", "body": ["\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:trig:side}", "在直角三角形中，斜边长为 $8$，其中一个角为", "$35^\\circ$，求该角的对边。涉及", "对边与斜边的比值为正弦：", "\\[", "\\sin 35^\\circ = \\frac{\\text{对边}}{8}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\text{对边} = 8 \\sin 35^\\circ \\approx 8 \\times 0.574 \\approx 4.6 .", "\\]", "对于邻边，使用余弦：", "$8\\cos 35^\\circ \\approx 8 \\times 0.819 \\approx 6.6$。可用", "毕达哥拉斯定理检验：$4.6^2 + 6.6^2 \\approx 21 + 43 \\approx 64 = 8^2$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[求角]\\label{met:g9:trig:angle}", "已知两边时，求出它们所成的比值，", "将其判定为未知角的余弦、正弦或正切，", "并对该比值使用计算器的反函数（$\\cos^{-1}$、$\\sin^{-1}$ 或 $\\tan^{-1}$）。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:trig:angle}", "一架长 $5$ m 的梯子斜靠在墙上，梯脚离墙", "的距离为 $1.4$ m。梯子与地面所成的角 $\\theta$ 满足", "\\[", "\\cos\\theta = \\frac{1.4}{5} = 0.28,", "\\qquad\\text{故}\\quad", "\\theta = \\cos^{-1}(0.28) \\approx 73.7^\\circ .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (1.4,0);", "  \\draw[thick] (1.4,0) -- (1.4,4.0);", "  \\draw[omDef, very thick] (0,0) -- (1.4,4.0);", "  \\draw[thin] (1.4,0) ++(-0.25,0) -- ++(0,0.25) -- ++(0.25,0);", "  \\draw[omThm, ->] (0.75,0) arc (0:70.7:0.75);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (1.15,0.55) {$\\theta$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.7,0) {$1.4$ m};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, left] at (0.62,2.1) {$5$ m};", "  \\draw[gray, thin] (-0.7,0) -- (2.3,0);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 梯子问题：邻边（$1.4$ m）与", "斜边（$5$ m）已知，故由余弦即可求出该角。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[特殊角]\\label{ex:g9:trig:special}", "两个三角形给出特殊角的精确值。边长为 1 的正方形的一半", "（直角等腰三角形）斜边长为 $\\sqrt2$，锐角均为 $45^\\circ$：", "\\[", "\\cos 45^\\circ = \\sin 45^\\circ = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2} = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2},", "\\qquad \\tan 45^\\circ = 1 .", "\\]", "边长为 1 的等边三角形的一半给出角 $30^\\circ$ 与", "$60^\\circ$：", "\\[", "\\cos 60^\\circ = \\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac12,", "\\qquad", "\\cos 30^\\circ = \\sin 60^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:1}", "一个直角三角形的两直角边长分别为 $9$ 和 $12$，求斜边长。另一个", "直角三角形斜边长为 $17$，一条直角边为 $8$，求另一条直角边。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:2}", "一个三角形的三边长为 $7$、$24$ 和 $25$，判断它是否为直角三角形。同样", "对三边长为 $5$、$6$ 和 $8$ 的三角形作判断。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:3}", "在直角三角形 $DEF$ 中，$D$ 为直角，记 $E$ 处的角为", "$\\theta$，哪条边是斜边？哪条边与", "$\\theta$ 相对？将 $\\cos\\theta$、$\\sin\\theta$ 和 $\\tan\\theta$ 表示为", "边 $DE$、$DF$、$EF$ 的比。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:4}", "在直角三角形中，斜边长为 $10$，一个锐角为", "$28^\\circ$。求两条直角边（四舍五入到十分位；", "$\\cos 28^\\circ \\approx 0.883$，$\\sin 28^\\circ \\approx 0.469$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:5}", "在直角三角形中，角 $\\theta$ 的邻边长为 $6$，", "对边长为 $4.5$。求 $\\tan\\theta$，再求 $\\theta$", "（四舍五入到整度；$\\tan^{-1}(0.75) \\approx 36.9^\\circ$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:6}", "一架无人机以 $120$ m 的高度飞行，地面观测者", "看到它的仰角为 $32^\\circ$。求无人机与观测者的", "水平距离", "（$\\tan 32^\\circ \\approx 0.625$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:7}", "一条通道坡道须升高 $1.2$ m，且与水平面的夹角", "至多为 $5^\\circ$。求坡道沿斜面方向的最短长度", "（$\\sin 5^\\circ \\approx 0.0872$）。结果向上取到", "最接近的十分之一米。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:trig:8}", "利用\\cref{prop:g9:trig:properties}：锐角 $\\theta$ 满足", "$\\cos\\theta = 0.6$。求 $\\sin\\theta$，不求 $\\theta$，然后", "求 $\\tan\\theta$。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}